        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "id": 1,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Runs side by side",
      "description": "One row per selected run, from the summary each run pushes. During a run these are numbers so far. With -speedup, times and GPU-hours are simulated.",
